ng planning. I wanted to repay the favor by sharing some insight on the vendors we used. I am happy to answer any questions or provide more details if needed :)\n\n\nHilton Rose Hall - wedding ceremony on West Beach &amp;amp; all guests stayed onsite\n\nThe resort is going through some renovations but all of our guests loved the lazy river, the food at the restaurants and the amazing hospitality of all the employees. Our wedding coordinator Renae Blackwell was an absolute pleasure to work with and everything was perfect!\n\n\nDay O Plantation - wedding reception\n\nJennifer, the owner, exceeded our expectations! She always responded within a few hours and nothing was too much to ask. The venue is breathtaking, the food was amazing (almost everyone had seconds), the cake was to die for and the decor was a perfect match to all of my Pinterest boards I shared in the months prior. Our guests have all said it was the best wedding reception they have ever attended and the price could not be beat. I highly recommend if you want a more authentic versus resort feel!\n\n\nJan&#039;s Flowers -\n\nOur bouquets and ceremony decor were beautiful. Their response time was impeccable and even with the potential outside vendor fee their prices are well below their competition. \n\n\nSungold - photography\n\nClayton was prompt and his passion for his work is contagious. The owner Paula, always responded in a very timely manner and was a pleasure to work with. We cannot wait to see the finished product.\n\n\nJamaica Water Sports - catamaran \/ snorkeling excursion\n\nAs a thank you to our guests, we invited them to join us for a day of sun after our wedding. Working with them to plan things out was a breeze. The crew was amazing and even provided individual attention to those that could not swim. They also guided us to the reefs and dazzled us with their knowledge. It was fun and amazing.","Attachments":[],"Id":1906577,"PostDate":1445288979,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello ladies! Thank you for all of your hints and ideas throughout my wedding planning. I wanted to repay the favor by sharing some insight on the vendors we used. I am happy to answer any questions or provide more details if needed <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nHilton Rose Hall - wedding ceremony on West Beach & all guests stayed onsite<br>\nThe resort is going through some renovations but all of our guests loved the lazy river, the food at the restaurants and the amazing hospitality of all the employees. Our wedding coordinator Renae Blackwell was an absolute pleasure to work with and everything was perfect!<br><br>\nDay O Plantation - wedding reception<br>\nJennifer, the owner, exceeded our expectations! She always responded within a few hours and nothing was too much to ask. The venue is breathtaking, the food was amazing (almost everyone had seconds), the cake was to die for and the decor was a perfect match to all of my Pinterest boards I shared in the months prior. Our guests have all said it was the best wedding reception they have ever attended and the price could not be beat. I highly recommend if you want a more authentic versus resort feel!<br><br>\nJan's Flowers -<br>\nOur bouquets and ceremony decor were beautiful. Their response time was impeccable and even with the potential outside vendor fee their prices are well below their competition. <br><br>\nSungold - photography<br>\nClayton was prompt and his passion for his work is contagious. The owner Paula, always responded in a very timely manner and was a pleasure to work with. We cannot wait to see the finished product.<br><br>\nJamaica Water Sports - catamaran \/ snorkeling excursion<br>\nAs a thank you to our guests, we invited them to join us for a day of sun after our wedding. Working with them to plan things out was a breeze. The crew was amazing and even provided individual attention to those that could not swim. They also guided us to the reefs and dazzled us with their knowledge. It was fun and amazing.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandra_co8@icloud.com","IpAddress":"50.162.188.193","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421710870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sandraco8","Id":281796,"Name":"Sandraco8","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79664","Title":"Montego Bay Wedding Review","LastPostDate":1445288979},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
